MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_001: One, two, three...
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_002: Hmmm, I guess that works? But I gotta do it quicker.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_003: Practicing your craft? You're not half bad.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_004: Oh, hey, Zarcone. Did you need something?
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_005: Hey, why are you so nervous? What'd I ever do\nto you?
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_006: Back when I was performing with my troupe, I heard\nrumors about bandits who ravaged the highlands.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_007: I heard they were dangerous and to steer clear. Were\nyou one of those bandits or something?
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_008: Hehehe. Ehhh, once upon a time I was a bandit, but\nall that's behind me. I don't steal anymore.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_009: I just wanted to see what you were doing. Can you\nshow me some?
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_010: Yeah, I guess I can show you if that's all you want.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_011: Next, I'll take this dagger and...one, two, yeah!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_012: Hehehe. I was curious where you'd go with it, but\na baby could do that trick.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_013: H-hey! Are you making fun of me?! That's why you\nasked me to show you, huh?!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_014: Aw, calm down. Let me show you something.\nSee that log over there? That'll be perfect.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_015: You take an axe like this, and... Hyah!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_016: Whoa! It sliced through the log like nothing!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_017: You like that one, eh? Kinda blows your parlor\ntricks out of the water.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_018: Is that what you think? Wellll, it was neat, but I\ncould outshine a move like that. Easy.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_019: Sounds like we got a sore loser. You don't got to put\non airs just cause your feelings are hurt.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_020: No airs are being put on. Ahem! I now present...a\nfamed blade from the land of Sai!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_021: Ooh, that's a sharp little number. OK. Now what \nare you gonna cut?
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_022: Patience, now... Behold! I take the sword like so,\nand... Hah!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_023: Whoa! You snapped that blade in half like it\nwas nothing!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_024: Oho, surprised, huh? There's a trick to it.
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_025: How'd you do that?! Y-you're not human! You gotta\nbe the WAR god's spawn or something!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_026: Huh? What're you talking about? Look, the trick to it\nis embedded here in the blade...
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_027: She's a god—a GOD! Aah! AAAAH! Help,\nsomeone, pleeease!
MID_SE_Hal_Zac_C_028: And he's gone. Well, he wanted a show, and a show\nhe got.